revision.text:
A '''factol''' is the title given to the leader of a [[faction]], although it does occasionally apply to [[sect]] leaders as well. Not all factions have a factol, depending on their internal structure.

The current factols of the factions of [[Sigil]] are:

* The [[Athar]]: Factol {{NPC|Terrance|planar|male|human|priest|19|Athar|lg}}
* The [[Bleak Cabal]]: Factol {{NPC|Lhar|planar|male|half-orc|fighter|8|Bleak Cabal|cn}}
* The [[Doomguard]]: Factol {{NPC|Pentar|planar|female|human|ranger|20|Doomguard|cn}}
* The [[Fated]]: Factol {{NPC|Rowan Darkwood|prime|male|human|ranger|19|Fated|cg}}, P20
* The [[Fraternity of Order]]: Factol {{NPC|Hashkar|petitioner|male|dwarf|sage|0|Fraternity of Order|ln}}
* The [[Harmonium]]: Factol {{NPC|Sarin|prime|male|human|paladin|16|Harmonium|lg}}
* The [[Heralds of Dust]]: Factol {{NPC|Skall|planar|male|lich|wizard|19|Dustmen|ne}}
* The [[Mercykillers]]: Factol {{NPC|Alisohn Nilesia|planar|female|tiefling|wizard|8|Mercykillers|le}}
* The [[Mind's Eye]]: Factol [[Saladryn]]
* The [[Ring Givers]]: [[Jeremo the Natterer]]
* The [[Society of Sensation]]: Factol {{NPC|Erin Darkflame Montgomery|planar|female|human|priest|9|Society of Sensation|lg}}
* The [[Transcendent Order]]: Factol {{NPC|Rhys|planar|female|human|fighter|15|Transcendent Order|n}}, W15

The [[Free League]] and [[Hands of Havoc]] do not have factols. The [[Incanterium]] may have one, but their identity is unknown.

[[O'pok]] the Fawning runs a history and propaganda museum in the [[Clerk's Ward]] dedicated to factols past and present.<ref name="uncaged71">{{b|Planescape|Uncaged: Faces of Sigil|pdf=17285|page=71}}</ref>


